Output demo/demo-team-daily.gif

Set Shell "bash"
Set FontSize 15
Set Width 900
Set Height 480
Set Theme "Dracula"
Set Padding 24
Set TypingSpeed 55ms
Set PlaybackSpeed 1

Hide
Type "source /home/sebastiadev/Escritorio/cortex-cli/demo/demo-env.sh && clear"
Enter
Sleep 800ms
Show

Type "# Dev A — push your sessions to the team"
Sleep 1.8s
Enter
Sleep 400ms
Type "cortex team push"
Sleep 500ms
Enter
Sleep 3.5s

Sleep 1.5s
Type "clear"
Enter
Sleep 300ms

Type "# Dev B — pull and get all team sessions instantly"
Sleep 1.8s
Enter
Sleep 400ms
Type "cortex team pull"
Sleep 500ms
Enter
Sleep 4s

Sleep 2s
